@@steps limit=6

## Controls
@@control attempts
How many times a rectangle is picked and a room tried. The demo’s counter goes up on every attempt, whether or not the room fits [[c02:41-55]].

## What it produces, measured
@@measured

Of 240 attempts, {{c02.rooms.median}} place a room at the median [[run:c02.rooms.median]]. The talk says of its animation that there are no rejections [[t:70-72]]. The demo records a frame only for a room that fits, so the attempts that fail are never shown [[c02:41-55]]. Against random rooms it places {{c02.rooms.median}} rooms to {{c01.rooms.median}} and opens {{c02.floor_share.median}} of the map to {{c01.floor_share.median}} [[run:c02.rooms.median c01.rooms.median c02.floor_share.median c01.floor_share.median]].

